  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weaving social peace within and between communities in conflict in Lebanon through change-oriented approaches</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of &#xBF;Tech for Memory&#xBF; is to foster a sense of citizenship and acceptance of diversity among Lebanese citizens from all regional, sectarian, and cultural backgrounds. To achieve this, the Action leverages arts and culture as tools for social change, providing both online and offline access to various forms of artistic and cultural representations of Lebanon&#xBF;s most significant historical milestones through a diverse array of lenses. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
